{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-10-1","title":"Proverbs 10:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 From this chapter to the five and twentieth are sundry observations of moral virtues, and their contrary vices.</p>\n<p>proverbs. 1:1; 25:1; 1Ki 4:32; Ec 12:9 A wise. 15:20; 17:21,25; 19:13; 23:15,16,24,25; 29:3,15; Ec 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-2","title":"Proverbs 10:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Treasures. 11:4; Ps 49:6-10; Isa 10:2,3; Zep 1:18; Lu 12:15-21; 16:22,23 Ro 2:5; Jas 5:1-3 but. 12:28; Da 4:27; Ro 5:21; Php 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-3","title":"Proverbs 10:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>will. Job 5:20; Ps 10:14; 33:19; 34:9,10; 37:3,19,25; Isa 33:16 Mt 6:30-33; Lu 12:22-24,31; Heb 13:5,6 but. Job 20:5-8,20-22,28; Hab 2:6-8; Zep 1:18 the substance of the wicked. or, the wicked for theirwickedness. 14:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-4","title":"Proverbs 10:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>becometh. 6:6-11; 11:24; 12:24; 19:15,24; 20:4,13; 24:30-34; Ec 10:18 Joh 6:27; Heb 6:11,12; 2Pe 1:5-10 with a slack hand.That is, slothfully and negligently.</p>\n<p>but. 13:4; 21:5; 1Co 15:58</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-5","title":"Proverbs 10:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>gathereth. 6:6,8; 30:25; Isa 55:6,7 a son. 12:4; 17:2; 19:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-6","title":"Proverbs 10:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Blessings. 11:26; 24:25; 28:20; De 28:2; Job 29:13; 2Ti 1:16-18 violence. 11; Es 7:8; Ps 107:42; Ro 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-7","title":"Proverbs 10:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>memory. 1Ki 11:36; 2Ki 19:34; 2Ch 24:16; Ps 112:6; Mr 14:9; Lu 1:48 the name. Job 18:17; 27:23; Ps 9:5,6; 109:13,15; Ec 8:10; Jer 17:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-8","title":"Proverbs 10:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>wise. 1:5; 9:9; 12:1; 14:8; Ps 119:34; Jas 3:13 but. 10; 12:13; 13:3; 14:23 prating fool. Heb. a fool of lips. Ec 10:12 fall. or, be beaten. 18:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-9","title":"Proverbs 10:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>that walketh. 28:18; Ps 23:4; 25:21; 26:11,12; 84:11; Isa 33:15,16; Ga 2:13,14 but. 17:20; Lu 12:1,2; 1Co 4:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-10","title":"Proverbs 10:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>that. 6:13; Job 15:12; Ps 35:19 but. 8; 18:6,7,21 fall. or, be beaten. 3Jo 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-11","title":"Proverbs 10:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>mouth of a. 20,21,32; 13:14; 15:7; 16:22-24; 18:4; 20:15; Ps 37:30,31; Eph 4:29 but. 6; Ps 107:42; Ec 10:12-14; Mt 12:34-37; Jas 3:5-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-12","title":"Proverbs 10:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Hatred. 15:18; 16:27; 28:25; 29:22; Jas 4:1 love. 17:9; 1Co 13:4; Jas 5:20; 1Pe 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-13","title":"Proverbs 10:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the lips. 11,21; 15:7,23; 20:15; 26:3; Ex 10:12; Isa 50:4; Lu 4:22 a rod. 10; 7:22; 17:10; 26:3; 27:22; Ps 32:9 understanding. Heb. heart. 6:32; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-14","title":"Proverbs 10:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>lay. 1:5; 9:9; 18:1,15; 19:8; Mt 12:35; 13:44,52; 2Co 4:6,7 the mouth. 8,10; 13:3; 18:7; 21:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-15","title":"Proverbs 10:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>rich. 18:11; Job 31:24,25; Ps 49:6; 52:7; Ec 7:12; Jer 9:23; Mr 10:24 Lu 12:19; 1Ti 6:17 the destruction. 14:20; 19:7; 22:22,23; Mic 2:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-16","title":"Proverbs 10:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>labour. 11:30; Isa 3:10,11; Joh 6:27; 1Co 15:58; Ga 6:7-9; Heb 6:10 the fruit. Mt 7:17,18; 12:33,34; 15:19; Ro 6:23; 2Ti 2:17,18; 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-17","title":"Proverbs 10:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the way. 3:1,2,18; 4:4,13; 12:1; 22:17-19; Mt 7:24-27; Lu 11:28; Heb 2:1 2Pe 1:5-11 he that. 1:25,26,30; 5:12; 15:10; 29:1; 2Ch 25:16; Heb 12:25 erreth. or, causeth to err. Ec 5:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-18","title":"Proverbs 10:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>that hideth. 26:24-26; 1Sa 18:21,22,29; 2Sa 3:27; 11:8-15; 13:23-29; 20:9,10 Ps 5:9; 12:2; 55:21; Lu 20:20,21 that uttereth. Ps 15:3; 50:20; 101:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-19","title":"Proverbs 10:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>the multitude. Ec 5:3; 10:13,14; Jas 3:2 but. 17:27,28; Ps 39:1; Jas 1:19; 3:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-20","title":"Proverbs 10:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>tongue. 12:18; 15:4; 16:13; 25:11,12; Mt 12:35 the heart. 23:7; Ge 6:5; 8:21; Jer 17:9; Mt 12:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-21","title":"Proverbs 10:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>feed. 12:18; 15:4; Job 4:3,4; 23:12; 29:21,22; Ps 37:30; Ec 12:9,10 Jer 3:15; 15:16; Joh 21:15-17; 1Pe 5:2 fools. 1:29,31; 5:12,23; Ho 4:6; Mt 13:19; Joh 3:19,20; Ro 1:28 wisdom. Heb. heart. 17:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-22","title":"Proverbs 10:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>it. Ge 12:2; 13:2; 14:23; 24:35; 26:12; De 8:17,18; 1Sa 2:7,8; Ps 37:22 Ps 107:38; 113:7,8 he. 20:21; 28:22; Jos 6:18; 7:1-26; 1Ki 21:19; 2Ki 5:26,27; Job 27:8-23 Hab 2:6-12; Zec 5:4; Jas 5:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-23","title":"Proverbs 10:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>14:9; 15:21; 26:18,19; Ec 11:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-24","title":"Proverbs 10:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>fear. Job 3:25; 15:21; Heb 10:27 the desire. Ps 21:2; 37:4; 145:19; Mt 5:6; Joh 14:18; 16:24; 1Jo 5:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-25","title":"Proverbs 10:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>the whirlwind. 1:27; Job 27:19-21; Ps 37:9,10; 58:9; 73:18-20; Isa 40:24 an. 30; Ps 15:5; Mt 7:24,25; 16:18; Eph 2:20; 1Ti 6:19; 2Ti 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-26","title":"Proverbs 10:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>vinegar. 25:13,20 as smoke.As the acidity of vinegar causes the unpleasantness and pain to the teeth, and by softening and dissolving the alkali of the bone, impairs their texture, and renders them incapable of mastication; and as smoke, by irritating the tender vessels, causes the eyes to smart, and prevents distinct vision; so a sluggish messenger is a continual vexation and loss to those by whom he is employed.</p>\n<p>Isa 65:5 so. Mt 25:26; Ro 12:11; Heb 6:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-27","title":"Proverbs 10:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>fear. 3:2,16; 9:11; Ps 21:4; 34:11-13; 91:16 prolongeth. Heb. addeth. the years. Job 15:32,33; 22:15,16; Ps 55:23; Ec 7:17; Jer 17:11; Lu 12:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-28","title":"Proverbs 10:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>hope. Ps 16:9; 73:24-26; Ro 5:2; 12:12; 15:13; 2Th 2:16 but. 11:7; 14:32; Job 8:13; 11:20; Ps 112:10; Lu 16:23-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-29","title":"Proverbs 10:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>way. Ps 84:7; Isa 40:31; Zec 10:12; Php 4:13 but. 21:15; Job 31:3; Ps 1:6; 36:12; 37:20; 92:7; Mt 7:22,23 Lu 13:26,27; Ro 2:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-30","title":"Proverbs 10:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>never. 25; Ps 16:8; 37:22,28,29; 112:6; 125:1; Ro 8:35-39; 2Pe 1:10,11 the wicked. Ps 37:9,10,22; 52:5; Eze 33:24-26; Mic 2:9,10; Mt 21:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-31","title":"Proverbs 10:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>mouth. 11,13,20,21; Ps 37:30 the froward. Ps 31:18; 63:11; 120:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-10-32","title":"Proverbs 10:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>know. Ec 12:10; Da 4:27; Tit 2:8 but. 11:11; 12:6,18; 15:2,28; 18:6-8 frowardness. Heb. frowardnesses.</p>"}]}